# Windows line endings where Windows tools need them, in every checkout AND in
# git archive -- which is what GitHub's "Download ZIP" serves. cmd.exe loses
# goto labels in an LF-only batch file ("The system cannot find the batch
# label specified"), and findstr's $ anchor needs the CR in the lists.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
ThreatLists/*.txt text eol=crlf
